      "cooked": "<p>Hi Team,</p>\n<p>When I create purchase receipt “GST Expense” is getting credited in the accounting ledger. If I see my Purchase Tax and charges tempalate, it is showing IGST account only.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/4/549ddc8ab6513588dc7584514eee9d89c6a062f1.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/549ddc8ab6513588dc7584514eee9d89c6a062f1\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/549ddc8ab6513588dc7584514eee9d89c6a062f1_2_690x485.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"c4yk6eNcymgVCNxDRlDEjY7AMQ9\" width=\"690\" height=\"485\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/549ddc8ab6513588dc7584514eee9d89c6a062f1_2_690x485.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/549ddc8ab6513588dc7584514eee9d89c6a062f1_2_1035x727.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/4/549ddc8ab6513588dc7584514eee9d89c6a062f1_2_1380x970.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1E1E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1934×1362 190 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>In Leger Preview at S.No. 1; GST Expense is showing, which is not correct.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/d/bd45148f74e9b738abbd63c4b1b90dca8e83a285.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/bd45148f74e9b738abbd63c4b1b90dca8e83a285\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/d/bd45148f74e9b738abbd63c4b1b90dca8e83a285_2_690x176.png\" alt=\"image\" da