 class=\"informations\">2050×1574 206 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Edit 1:</p>\n<p>I did some debugging and changed “Consider Tax or Charge for” to “Valuation and total”. Now the stock in hand amount is more than Grand total. So this seems very wrong.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/0/60ed04791687ef7fcf50f60b9c83b4e0dc4bbe8d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/60ed04791687ef7fcf50f60b9c83b4e0dc4bbe8d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60ed04791687ef7fcf50f60b9c83b4e0dc4bbe8d_2_690x222.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"dPrDYrtBJ7LliV5GgUa8UDFmtgV\" width=\"690\" height=\"222\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60ed04791687ef7fcf50f60b9c83b4e0dc4bbe8d_2_690x222.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60ed04791687ef7fcf50f60b9c83b4e0dc4bbe8d_2_1035x333.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/0/60ed04791687ef7fcf50f60b9c83b4e0dc4bbe8d_2_1380x444.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"212121\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2118×684 68.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
